            "description": "<p>Yahoo Finance's <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/john-hyland/\">John Hyland</a> outlines some of the top stories on Wall Street as part of Monday's <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Market Minute</a>, including Amazon's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMZN\">AMZN</a>) OpenAI (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/OPAI.PVT\">OPAI.PVT</a>) deal, Microsoft (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSFT\">MSFT</a>) partnering with Lambda (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/LAMD.PVT\">LAMD.PVT</a>), and Ford (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/F\">F</a>) and Hyundai's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/005380.KS\">005380.KS</a>) declining electric vehicle (EV) sales.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
            "summary": "Yahoo Finance's John Hyland outlines some of the top stories on Wall Street as part of Monday's Market Minute, including Amazon's (AMZN) OpenAI (OPAI.PVT) deal, Microsoft (MSFT) partnering with Lambda (LAMD.PVT), and Ford (F) and Hyundai's (005380.KS) declining electric vehicle (EV) sales. Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.",
